h God all things are possible  this sounds like such a condemnation go  sell all you have give to the poor and  follow me and the man doesn't do it it  goes away but we never know what happens  that's the funny thing about this story  never tells us what happens to the rich  man I like to think Jesus wants  everybody in the kingdom Jesus gonna  find a way I think maybe a month maybe a  year maybe 10 years maybe 20 years this  man changed his attitude to his wealth  sold it gave it away and became a new  person it's possible for any of us any  time we can approach the throne of grace  with boldness because he's been there  before us amen
 

